### 댓글 목록
# @name list
GET http://localhost:4000/api/comments

### 댓글 올리기
# @name created
POST http://localhost:4000/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": 1,
  "username": "yuna",
  "content": "저도 가보고 싶어요",
  "likeCount": 500
}

### content 없이 올리기
POST http://localhost:4000/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": 1,
  "username": "yuna"
}

### 방금 올린 댓글 지우기
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/comments/{{created._id}}

### 지운 뒤 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/comments
